 HISTORY                                                          8305 1451
 -------                                                          8305 1451
 This library was produced by the Low Energy Interaction Physics  8305 1451
 (LEIP) group at North Carolina State University, USA. The        8305 1451
 inelastic scattering thermal scattering law data for uranium     8305 1451
 mononitride (UN) was developed using ab initio lattice dynamics  8305 1451
 methods [1-2]. The Full Law Analysis Scattering System Hub       8305 1451
 (FLASSH) code was used to produce MF=7 and MT=2 and 4 for U in   8305 1451
 UN (U 5% enrichment) [3]. MAT=8305 and ZA=8405 are used for U in 8305 1451
 UN (U 5% enrichment).                                            8305 1451
